{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"wang-xueqi","name":"Wang Xueqi","birthDate":"1946-03-19","birthPlace":"Beijing, China","bio":"Wang Xueqi (Chinese: 王学圻; born 19 March 1946) is a Chinese film actor whose career has spanned over 25 years. He was often cast in early Fifth Generation films, such as Chen Kaige's Yellow Earth (1984) and The Big Parade (1986), Huang Jianxin's Samsara, and Zhang Yimou's Codename Cougar (1989). He has since carved out a niche in the Chinese market as a character actor.\n\nHe has recently appeared in award-winning roles in Forever Enthralled (2008) and Bodyguards and Assassins (2009)","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:35:55+00:00","tmdbId":77303,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/77303","credits":[{"id":"iron-man-3","title":"Iron Man 3","character":"Doctor Wu","characterFa":"دکتر وو"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/wang-xueqi.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Northward","year":2025,"character":"Zhou Yipu","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4D8DBDvQZ5EbfWAuMSulCTAfiTr.jpg"},{"name":"War of Faith","year":2024,"character":"Xu Nuo","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dEfojxMIcvNIi7pIRskUMb27exV.jpg"},{"name":"I Am Nobody","year":2023,"character":"Zhang Zhiwei","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aZT7iZwR4LE2kk7sXWslgpOP7oT.jpg"},{"name":"China in the classics","year":2021,"character":"司马迁（老年）","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/beQmPZh4Qst88KTm9FUiDEMhs01.jpg"},{"name":"Win The Future","year":2021,"character":"Chen Mingyi","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lqgslOzpwlabYOg6GDyGZRBqxEw.jpg"},{"name":"The Best of Times","year":2020,"character":"Li Jianye","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kfHUyyQxCUG2QHkANJDJPJJxj7B.jpg"},{"name":"Skyfire","year":2019,"character":"Wentao Li","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dDf8M1yMwvBVe8VtOKxCpOog8CF.jpg"},{"name":"Ming Dynast